### 获取报表列表 (标准任务)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/report/list?taskId=1&taskType=0&page=1&size=10
Authorization: __CONFIGURE_LOCALLY__
Content-Type: application/json

### 获取报表列表 (Openclaw 任务)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/report/list?taskId=3&taskType=1&page=1&size=10
Authorization: __CONFIGURE_LOCALLY__
Content-Type: application/json
